    "body": "The earlier offline Prefix objective covered three word fragments and could correct that word while the reply continued incorrectly. This adds complete-episode credit for the frozen fifteen-token authored reply, including punctuation/EOS, alongside the same seventeen reference roles: 32 roles coalesce into 31 physical gradients. The one-pass native constructor retains all 380 original correct-prefix guards and reloads the 391-state union. Original witnesses are reused, only seven missing conditional states are captured, and legacy/compact U count formats must agree exactly. The serving path is unchanged.\n\nOne fresh run reduces combined CE from 5.1115207302 to 3.7987731056 and improves conditional winners from 5/15 to 9/15, retaining all references and guards. Positions 7–10, punctuation and EOS still fail, so the candidate remains unselected and actual autoregressive qualification is NOT_RUN. The saved terminal witness locates an unchanged Generate+U competition at donor7 with no EOS/rival Copy aliases; it supports a prospective shared readout learning question after delivery, without a capacity or language claim. The exact evidence and current-state entry retain initialization, artifacts, limits, negative outcomes and the causal successor.\n\nValidation at exact final head b627d27677f1aecd8d27e5d4c7d25411ca56a7a1:\n\n- 95 focused Rust example tests, optimized CUDA-feature build, formatting, claim-wording and diff checks PASS; log db2996be9eeaeab4a9c84af59fe69006b66289918386739d4c7aa09f81d60b18. The final build is separate from the measured bd7963/5dd6ae run.\n- Reviewed independent saved arithmetic PASS: 39,230 reconstructed pools and 801 snapshots validate the saved 31 weighted gradients, 32 CE roles, 960 transactions, 380 guards and 391 reloads. This is not an independent backward or autoregressive replication. New producer and audit complete-file Rust verification PASS.\n- Exact source/config/reader/result reviews and owner-authorized final-head review53ae28df are retained. Complete private evidence edc09ef4 is freshly downloaded and SHA verified; all 649 archive members match the file manifest. No local download or foreign-lab modification occurred. Historical transport status names are compatibility acknowledgements, not tests.\n\nReferences #820\n",
